{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05937","headline":"黄雀痴 · 王维","name":"黄雀痴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄雀痴，黄雀痴，谓言青鷇是我儿。\n一一口衔食，养得成毛衣。\n到大啁啾解游扬，各自东西南北飞。\n薄暮空巢上，羇雌独自归。\n凤凰九雏亦如此，慎莫愁思顦顇损容辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}